        "period": ["00-06", "06-09", "09-15", "15-18", "18-24"],
        "type": ["Thermal0", "Thermal1", "Thermal2"]
      }
    }
  ],
  "note": "The objective first minimises total thermal output across all periods and types, then minimises total generating cost among those plans."
}